{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_02_cleanup_recipes_cleanup_recipes", "label": "Cleanup recipes", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/02-cleanup-recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The contract resolves differently depending on what the effect touches. Two of react.dev's cases need no cleanup."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_02_cleanup_recipes_idempotent_setup", "label": "Idempotent setup needs no cleanup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/02-cleanup-recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "map.setZoomLevel(12) twice leaves the map at 12. Setters are usually idempotent; anything that opens, pushes or begins usually is not."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_02_cleanup_recipes_showmodal_cleanup", "label": "dialog.showModal needs close", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/02-cleanup-recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A second showModal on an already-open dialog throws. Cleanup makes the extra cycle legal and closes on unmount."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_02_cleanup_recipes_same_handler_reference", "label": "removeEventListener needs the same handler reference", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/02-cleanup-recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Declare the handler inside setup so both calls close over one binding. A recreated function silently removes nothing."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_02_cleanup_recipes_animation_reset", "label": "Undo an animation by resetting, not reversing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/02-cleanup-recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "opacity 1 then 0 then 1 matches setting 1 once. For tweening libraries reset the timeline to its initial state."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_02_cleanup_recipes_analytics_no_cleanup", "label": "Analytics POST needs no cleanup", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/02-cleanup-recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The double call is development-only and development traffic should not be in the metrics. A POST that changes application state has neither property."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_02_cleanup_recipes_idempotent_setup", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_indistinguishable_sequence", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/02-cleanup-recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_02_cleanup_recipes_showmodal_cleanup", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_symmetrical_cleanup", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/02-cleanup-recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_02_cleanup_recipes_same_handler_reference", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_symmetrical_cleanup", "relation": "implements", "c